stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> AskUsage: overlay sent
  AskUsage --> ParseAnswer: user replies
  AskDiscard --> ParseAnswer: user replies
  AskZones --> ParseAnswer: user replies
  ParseAnswer --> Clarify: ambiguous reference
  Clarify --> ParseAnswer: user picks
  ParseAnswer --> Echo: facts applied
  ParseAnswer --> Defaults: "skip"
  Echo --> AskDiscard: after usage
  Echo --> AskZones: after discard, zones exist
  Echo --> BuildPlan: after discard, no zones
  Echo --> BuildPlan: after zones
  Defaults --> BuildPlan
  BuildPlan --> [*]: phase = planned
